# Campus Companion

Campus Companion is a student productivity website designed to help students manage their daily academic activities in one place.

## About the Project

Campus Companion provides different features that help students organize their college life easily. The website allows students to manage their timetable, tasks, notes, attendance and calculate their CGPA.

## Features

- Student Profile Setup
- Dashboard
- Timetable Management
- Task Management
- Attendance Tracking
- CGPA Calculator
- Notes Management
- Dark Mode
- Data Storage using Local Storage
- Responsive and user-friendly interface

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Font Awesome
- Local Storage

